eds immediately after planting to ensure good seed-to-soil contact.\n\n4. **Weed management**: Weed the area regularly to keep the soil free of weeds that compete with the wheat for nutrients and light.\n\n5. **Monitor and harvest**: Keep an eye on the wheat plants and harvest them when they reach the desired maturity, typically 6 to 8 weeks after planting.\n\nRemember, wheat grows best in well-drained, fertile soil with a neutral to slightly acidic pH.", "embedding": [-0.02596014365553856, 0.014835497364401817, 0.015139362774789333, -0.025211231783032417, 0.0341666117310524, 0.029143067076802254, -0.023304494097828865, -0.004820084199309349, -0.05873039737343788, 0.10291913151741028, 0.08809401839971542, -0.05611365661025047, -0.03292268514633179, -0.08138001710176468, -0.04747679829597473, -0.0100771589204669, 0.01680588908493519, 0.10695816576480865, -0.10354196280241013, -0.04787740111351013, 0.0484316423535347, 0.05064600706100464, -0.009605713188648224, -0.04762612655758858, 0.07690973579883575, 0.009714420884847641, 0.001363595831207931, -0.0030002854764461517, 0.007189548574388027, -0.03512731194496155, -0.03401065617799759, 0.10706538707017899, 0.025984596461057663, -0.031975943595170975, -0.06063174456357956, 0.01151416078209877, 0.032760098576545715, -0.04366438463330269, 0.059365130960941315, -0.007797352038323879, 0.0011181618319824338, -0.09045986831188202, 0.03267078101634979, -0.06941168755292892, -0.007346940692514181, -0.009142912924289703, 0.0613986998796463, 0.042863987386226654, 0.09787369519472122, -0.02318643219769001, 0.011523709632456303, 0.041726239025592804, 0.030064119026064873, -0.011503916233778, -0.06705253571271896, 0.07746953517198563, -0.06119542196393013, 0.09788118302822113, -0.017563283443450928, 0.06430722773075104, 0.03054131381213665, 0.04871521145105362, -0.09317483007907867, -0.03238769248127937, 0.011931316927075386, -0.05006999894976616, -0.04712492972612381, 0.006373526994138956, 0.02121189422905445, -0.007182412780821323